      "codex": "abbot_ledger",
      "text": "A long ledger in a beautiful, even hand, every entry dated. 'Yevgeni B., a hound's patience, for his temper; took well.' 'Old Marta B., wings, for her lightness of spirit; did not take. Wards.' 'Little Ilsa B., an owl's eyes, for the dark; took.' The last pages are a different list: 'Left hand, from the grave of a seamstress. Throat, from a singer. Eyes, two, from sisters, to be matched.' At the bottom: 'Something white.'"
